cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Pillow-AllSIMD, please cite it as below, and cite Pillow, whose
  library and documentation it builds on, and Pillow-SIMD, which it forks.
title: Pillow-AllSIMD
abstract: >-
  A fork of Pillow-SIMD, the SIMD build of the Pillow imaging library for
  Python, with SIMD kernels for x86-64 (SSE4, AVX2, AVX-VNNI) and arm64
  (NEON), Pillow's results by default and an opt-in fast mode.
type: software
authors:
